    "whats_in_it": {
      "type": "dh-media-text",
      "blocks": {
        "p1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You read labels for a reason, so here's the whole list, in the order on the tube:</p>"
          }
        },
        "inci": {
          "type": "box",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Aqua, Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil, Mesembryanthemum Crystallinum Juice, Persea Gratissima Oil, Alcohol, Glycerin, Arachis Hypogaea Oil, Cetearyl Alcohol, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil, Papaver Somniferum Seed Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Lanolin, Lysolecithin, Hectorite, Tapioca Starch, Mangifera Indica Seed Butter, Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil, Chondrus Crispus Extract, Cetearyl Glucoside, Xanthan Gum, Amyris Balsamifera Bark Oil, Rosmarinus Officinalis Leaf Extract.</p>"
          }
        },
        "why": {
          "type": "placeholder",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Why there's alcohol and one oil: The alcohol helps keep the cream fresh without synthetic preservatives. A little amyris oil is added to the alcohol by law, so it can't be drunk.</p>",
            "show": true
          }
        },
        "know": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Good to know before you buy: it contains peanut oil, sweet almond oil and lanolin. Amyris oil contains eugenol, which some people react to. If you're allergic to any of these, this cream isn't for you.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
