          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Dr. Hauschka creams are made by WALA, in Germany, from plants. The company has made skincare since 1967. In Singapore, Lyne Ong and her team at PamperInc sell it from their International Plaza studio and online.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Another Dr. Hauschka cream, the Apricot Day Cream, won the “Dry skin” category at Daily Vanity's Beauty Awards 2026.</p>"
