    "faq": {
      "type": "dh-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "Is it fragrance-free?",
            "answer": "<p>No perfume is added. It does contain a little amyris oil, an essential oil the maker adds to the alcohol (see “What's in it”). Any smell comes from the plants in it. One buyer calls it “a very light, earthy smell”.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "Will it sting?",
            "answer": "<p>It's made for very dry, sensitive skin, and buyers with sensitive skin say it suits them. Everyone's skin is different, so try a small patch first. If it doesn't suit you within 30 days, Lyne's promise gives you your S$79 back.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "Is it heavy?",
            "answer": "<p>It's a light cream that sinks in fast and works under make-up.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "S$79 is a lot for one tube. What am I paying for?",
            "answer": "<p>A face cream made around ice plant juice, with no perfume added, from WALA in Germany, who have made skincare since 1967. And if it ends up in the drawer like the others, you get your money back.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "Natural creams have set my skin off before. Why is this one different?",
            "answer": "<p>We won't tell you natural means gentle. We can tell you what's in it. No perfume is added, and all 23 ingredients are listed, nut oils included. Read the list, try a small patch, and you still have 30 days to decide.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "Is it the real thing? What about expiry dates?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Lyne orders it from WALA, the maker in Germany, and we send it out from our International Plaza studio. Want to see the expiry date before you pay? WhatsApp us on +65 9751 6279 and we'll send you a photo of the tube you'll get.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "Does it have steroids?",
            "answer": "<p>No. It's a cosmetic face cream. If a doctor has given you a cream for your skin, ask them how to use both.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "How do I get the free facial?",
            "answer": "<p>Spend S$200 with us within 12 months and you get one free 1-hour facial at our International Plaza studio. We email you a code, and you WhatsApp us to book.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "How does Lyne's 30-day promise work?",
            "answer": "<p>If the Face Cream doesn't suit your skin within 30 days of delivery, WhatsApp us on +65 9751 6279 with a photo of the tube. Choose S$79 store credit or your S$79 back. You don't need to send it back. One claim per customer.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        },
        "q10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "show": true,
            "question": "When will it arrive?",
            "answer": "<p>We pack orders every morning and the courier collects the next working day. Delivery is free from S$100. You can also collect from International Plaza.</p>",
            "note": ""
          }
        }
